v1.2 (client: v1.7)
- Added more server attributes (`Server.password`, `Server.guests`, `Server.tcp_port`, `Server.ws_url`, `Server.private`).
- Added more configuration variables (`[Server] SERVER_PASSWORD`, `[Server] GUESTS`, `[Server] TCP_PORT`, `[Server] WS_URL`, `[Server] PRIVATE`).
- Updated `Server.initialze()`: added `tcp_server` parameter.